# xm_gamekey emits F1/F2 for trigger presses and F3..F6 for slider
# open/close. AresParts reads the state from /dev/gamekey directly;
# without this file the Generic.kl mapping leaks function-key events
# to whatever app is focused. Map them all to nothing.
